bsc-fleet() { echo "bsc-fleet is SUPERSEDED — it read a LAUNCH MANIFEST and reported coord.log activity rather than process liveness, so a worker whose process exited an hour ago printed the same as a live one. Use \`bsc fleet list\` (real liveness + pid, from the running app), \`bsc fleet wake <pane-id>\`, \`bsc fleet clone\`, \`bsc fleet doctor\`. Run \`bsc fleet help\` for the rest." >&2; return 1; }
